y’s potato chips and Maggi noodles.India’s Maharashtra state, where Mumbai is the capital, has intensified a food safety drive under the new head of the state’s Food and Drug Administration, Tukaram Mundhe, whose surprise inspections at elite clubs and restaurants have made him an online and TV celebrity.“I am absolutely shocked by the scale. It is like organized activity. It’s been done systematically,...", "published_at": "2026-09-01T11:29:23+00:00", "image_url": "https://i.brecorder.com/large/2026/09/0116284871b7260.webp", "source": {"name": "Business Recorder", "tier": "international", "url": "https://www.brecorder.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 49, "sensationalism": 12, "opinion_fact": 9, "factual_rigor": 52, "framing": 18, "confidence": 0.67, "rationale": {"lean": {"keyword_score": 50.0, "framing_shift": 0.0, "entity_shift": -1.0, "sentence_direction": 0.0, "text_score": 49.0, "source_baseline": 50, "text_shift": -1.0, "delta_max": 24, "confidence": 1.0, "top_left_keywords": [], "top_right_keywords": [], "framing_phrases_found": [], "entity_sentiments": {"trump": -0.1}, "state_affiliated": false, "unscored": true}, "sensationalism": {"headline_score": 2.0, "body_score": 8.8, "clickbait_signals": 0, "superlative_density": 0.0, "urgency_density": 0.11, "hyperbole_density": 0.11, "measured_density": 0.33, "partisan_attack_density": 0.0}, "opinion": {"pronoun_score": 2.7, "subjectivity_score": 33.4, "modal_score": 4.3, "hedging_score": 0.0, "attribution_score": 15.2, "metadata_score": 0.0, "value_judgment_score": 0.0, "absolutist_assertion_score": 0.0, "classification": "Reporting", "dominant_signals": ["subjectivity", "attribution_gaps", "modal_language"]}, "coverage": {"named_sources_count": 2, "org_citations_count": 7, "data_points_count": 5, "direct_quotes_count": 6, "vague_sources_count": 0, "specificity_ratio": 0.0}, "framing": {"connotation_score": 30.7, "keyword_emphasis_score": 1.6, "omission_score": 40.0, "headline_body_divergence": 14.5, "has